# Copy must stay true

Zero-trust: Core never stores target SSH passwords or private keys. Metadata only.

2FA: WebSSH, proxy, telemetry, tasks, agent create/rotate require `is_2fa_enabled`.

Agent: outbound WSS only; no inbound listen. Telemetry lives in Redis with TTL, not PostgreSQL.

Prefixes: `vxk_` API keys, `vxa_` agent secrets (shown once), `vxp_` plugin tokens.

If a requested slogan implies cloud-held keys, rewrite it. Update RU and EN together in `src/copy.ts`.
